<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>At some time or other the Lord will provide:</l><l>It may not be my time, it may not be thy time;</l><l>And yet in His own time, “the Lord will provide.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Despond then no longer; the Lord will provide:</l><l>And this be the token—no word He hath spoken</l><l>Was ever yet broken: “The Lord will provide.”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>March on then right boldly: the sea shall divide;</l><l>The pathway made glorious, with shoutings victorious,</l><l>We’ll join in the chorus, “The Lord will provide.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
